  <section class="cols" style="max-width:900px;margin:0 auto">
    <div class="col">
      <h2>What&rsquo;s inside</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Fifty-two mantras across twelve themes &mdash; one a week for a year</li>
        <li>A full-page illustrated mantra facing every worksheet</li>
        <li>A weekly recall tracker on each page</li>
        <li>Blank pages at the end for your own mantras</li>
        <li>A grounding practice to begin from</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="swatchrow" aria-hidden="true">
        <i style="background:#8FAFAE"></i><i style="background:#F6A28A"></i><i style="background:#F5CC27"></i><i style="background:#E96B2B"></i><i style="background:#447570"></i>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col">
      <h2>The four prompts on every page</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>How do I interpret this mantra?</li>
        <li>How can I relate this to my life?</li>
        <li>When can this be useful to me?</li>
        <li>What things may help me recall this mantra?</li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="keyrule" aria-hidden="true">
