  <!-- ==================== HOW A SPREAD WORKS ==================== -->
  <h2>How a spread works</h2>
  <section class="spread">
    <figure><img data-img="sheet" width="780" height="1178" alt="A workbook worksheet with four prompts and a weekly recall tracker"></figure>
    <div>
      <p>Every mantra gets a full illustrated page, and the page facing it is yours to fill in.</p>
      <p>Four prompts move the phrase from something you read to something you use &mdash; what it
         means, where it lands in your life, when to reach for it, and what will bring it back to mind.</p>
      <p>A row of boxes at the foot of each page tracks how often you recalled it that week.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

